{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09013","headline":"使云阳寄府曹 · 韦应物","name":"使云阳寄府曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夙驾祗府命，冒炎不遑息。\n百里次云阳，闾阎问漂溺。\n上天屡愆气，胡不均寸泽。\n仰瞻乔树巅，见此洪流迹。\n良苗免湮没，蔓草生宿昔。\n颓墉满故墟，喜返将安宅。\n周旋涉涂潦，侧峭缘沟脉。\n仁贤忧斯民，贱子甘所役。\n公堂衆君子，言笑思与觌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09013.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09013","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}